 "name": "Creamer C2 \u2014 stop under the 5-min swing low",
 "description": "Value-up on the hourly (close > EMA20). Step 1: a 5-min bar's low probes the 70.5\u201388.6 % retracement of the last 15-min swing leg (discount). Step 2, within 6 bars: a bar with net aggressive selling that closes bullish (sellers absorbed). Trigger, within 3 bars: a bullish bar with a higher low (sellers fail higher) \u2192 long at its close, stop 1 pt under that bar, target 2R. 09:30\u201311:00, \u2265 10k contracts/5-min, max 2 trades/day, stop after 2 losses. Mirrored for shorts.",
